connect_supply_set	CommandSpec { name: "connect_supply_set", pack_source_sandbox_helper: false, traits: Traits(0), surface: Some([SpecSurface { provider: Core(Tcl), windows: [("8.4", Some("9.2"))] }]), arity: Arity { count: Arguments, min: 1, max: 65535, step: 0, also_exact: None }, arity_windows: [], arg_roles: [], arg_role_resolver: None, arg_role_count_resolver: None, arg_role_layout_resolver: None, arg_role_resolver_roles: [], clause_grammar: None, arg_presentation: [], repeated_args: [], frame_effect: None, clause_shape_check: None, command_prefixes: [], command_prefix_resolver: None, script_timing_resolver: None, script_lookup_scope: None, substitution_resolver: None, callback_taint_inputs: [], return_type: None, return_type_hook: None, var_write_typing: ReturnValue, variable_write_min_args: None, return_elements: None, var_elements_effect: None, representation_effect: None, arg_types: [], subcommands: [], prefix_matching: Enabled, allow_unknown_subcommands: false, default_form_first_word: None, hover: Some(HoverSnippet { summary: "Connect a supply set to particular elements.", synopsis: ["connect_supply_set supply_set_ref ?-connect {supply_function pg_type_list}...? ?-elements element_list? ?-exclude_elements exclude_list? ?-transitive ?TRUE|FALSE??"], snippet: "Connects a supply set to the specified elements, propagating its nets through implicitly created ports and nets across the descendant subtree of the current scope, with higher precedence than implicit and automatic connection semantics. Element list filtering depends on whether supply_set_ref is a domain handle, which filters and populates elements by domain extent, or a strategy handle, which filters by the elements connected to the strategy's supply.", source: "IEEE 1801-2024 §6.15", examples: "connect_supply_set some_supply_set  -elements {U1/U_mem}  -connect {power primary_power}  -connect {ground primary_ground}", return_value: "The empty string if successful; otherwise a TCL_ERROR is raised." })