name_format	CommandSpec { name: "name_format", pack_source_sandbox_helper: false, traits: Traits(0), surface: Some([SpecSurface { provider: Core(Tcl), windows: [("8.4", Some("9.2"))] }]), arity: Arity { count: Arguments, min: 0, max: 65535, step: 0, also_exact: None }, arity_windows: [], arg_roles: [], arg_role_resolver: None, arg_role_count_resolver: None, arg_role_layout_resolver: None, arg_role_resolver_roles: [], clause_grammar: None, arg_presentation: [], repeated_args: [], frame_effect: None, clause_shape_check: None, command_prefixes: [], command_prefix_resolver: None, script_timing_resolver: None, script_lookup_scope: None, substitution_resolver: None, callback_taint_inputs: [], return_type: None, return_type_hook: None, var_write_typing: ReturnValue, variable_write_min_args: None, return_elements: None, var_elements_effect: None, representation_effect: None, arg_types: [], subcommands: [], prefix_matching: Enabled, allow_unknown_subcommands: false, default_form_first_word: None, hover: Some(HoverSnippet { summary: "Define the format for constructing names of implicitly created objects.", synopsis: ["name_format ?-isolation_prefix pattern? ?-isolation_suffix pattern? ?-level_shift_prefix pattern? ?-level_shift_suffix pattern? ?-implicit_supply_suffix string? ?-implicit_logic_prefix string? ?-implicit_logic_suffix string?"], snippet: "Sets the prefix and suffix patterns used to synthesize names for implicitly created objects -- new isolation cells, level-shifter cells, and implicit supply or logic nets and ports -- by prepending any prefix and appending any suffix to the base name of the original port or net, combining multiple applicable affixes in alphabetical order of the option name and resolving generated-name collisions with a numeric instance index. Pattern strings may embed the reserved variables %d for the domain of the inserting strategy, %s for the name of that strategy, and %i for the instance index. It shall be an error to specify an affix more than once in a single call, and calling name_format with no options resets the name format to the default values.", source: "IEEE 1801-2024 §6.41", examples: "name_format -isolation_prefix \"MY_ISO_\" -isolation_suffix \"\"\nname_format -level_shift_prefix \"shift_%d_%s_\" -level_shift_suffix \"%i_UPF_LS\"", return_value: "The empty string if successful; otherwise a TCL_ERROR is raised." }), forms: [FormSpec { kind: Default, synopsis: "name_format ?-isolation_prefix pattern? ?-isolation_suffix pattern? ?-level_shift_prefix pattern? ?-level_shift_suffix pattern? ?-implicit_supply_suffix string? ?-implicit_logic_prefix string? ?-implicit_logic_suffix string?", surface: None, lifecycle: Lifecycle { introduced: None, deprecated: None, retired: None, deprecation_fix: None } }], command_forms: [], semantic_operation: None, semantic_operation_windows: [], completion: None, result_stability: None, native_result: None, assigns_variable_at: None, safe_on_uninit: None, const_fold: None, const_fold_versioned: None, lowering_hook: None, bpf_op: None, codegen_hook: None, codegen_hook_windows: [], inline_codegen_hook: None, inline_codegen_hook_windows: [], native_lowering: None, native_lowering_windows: [], semantics: Inherited, analyser_hook: None, command_table_effect: None, side_effects: [], world_effects: None, state_transitions: None, dispatch_dependencies: None, literal_argument_validator: None, source_index_bounds: None, inferred_storage_type: None, required_package: Some("upf"), tk_geometry: None, excluded_events: [], unsafe_command: false, closed_value_args: [], arg_values_accept_prefix: false, event_requires: None, event_requirement_forms: [], event_emits: None, event_emission_forms: [], data_collection: None, irules_source_flow: None, side_switch_target: None, event_handler_priority: None, irules_top_level_effect: None, options: [OptionSpec { name: "-isolation_prefix", value: Takes(OptionArg { arity: One, role: Value, also_role: None, taints_var_write: false, variable_sc