iving one input pin, one output pin, and one optional enable pin.", surface: None, aliases: [], lifecycle: Lifecycle { introduced: None, deprecated: None, retired: None, deprecation_fix: None }, min_abbrev: None, effect: None }, OptionSpec { name: "-no_enable", value: Takes(OptionArg { arity: One, role: Value, also_role: None, taints_var_write: false, variable_scope: CurrentFrame, body_kind: Plain, script_timing: SameInvocation, callback_taint_inputs: [], values: [ArgValue { value: "high", detail: "", min_tcl: None, lifecycle: Lifecycle { introduced: None, deprecated: None, retired: None, deprecation_fix: None }, code: None }, ArgValue { value: "low", detail: "", min_tcl: None, lifecycle: Lifecycle { introduced: None, deprecated: None, retired: None, deprecation_fix: None }, code: None }, ArgValue { value: "hold", detail: "", min_tcl: None, lifecycle: Lifecycle { introduced: None, deprecated: None, retired: None, deprecation_fix: None }, code: None }], closed: true, integer: None, hint: "no_enable", appended_arity: Unknown }), detail: "States the cell has no enable pin and gives the output value when the switchable supply is powered down, where hold means the pre-power-down logic value is held.", surface: None, aliases: [], lifecycle: Lifecycle { introduced: None, deprecated: None, retired: None, deprecation_fix: None }, min_abbrev: None, effect: None }, OptionSpec { name: "-always_on_pins", value: Takes(OptionArg { arity: One, role: Value, also_role: None, taints_var_write: false, variable_scope: CurrentFrame, body_kind: Plain, script_timing: SameInvocation, callback_taint_inputs: [], values: [], closed: false, integer: None, hint: "pin_list", appended_arity: Unknown }), detail: "A list of cell pins related to the nonswitchable power and nonswitchable ground pins of the cell.", surface: None, aliases: [], lifecycle: Lifecycle { introduced: None, deprecated: None, retired: None, deprecation_fix: None }, min_abbrev: None, effect: None }, OptionSpec { name: "-aux_enab