t rules of -valid_location. If a list of voltage ranges is specified for the input supply voltage, a list with the same number of elements shall also be specified for the output supply voltage. It shall be an error if neither -input_voltage_range nor -ground_input_voltage_range is specified, and it shall be an error if the same input or output pin appears in more than one -pin_groups group.", source: "IEEE 1801-2024 §7.5", examples: "define_level_shifter_cell  -cells LSHL  -input_voltage_range {{1.0 1.0}}  -output_voltage_range {{0.8 0.8}}  -direction high_to_low  -input_power_pin VH -ground G\ndefine_level_shifter_cell -cells mbit_en_ls  -pin_groups {{datain1 els_dataout1 en1} {datain2 els_dataout2 en2}}", return_value: "The empty string if successful; otherwise a TCL_ERROR is raised." }), forms: [FormSpec { kind: Default, synopsis: "define_level_shifter_cell -cells cell_list ?-input_voltage_range {{lower_bound upper_bound}...}? ?-output_voltage_range {{lower_bound upper_bound}...}? ?-ground_input_voltage_range {{lower_bound upper_bound}...}? ?-ground_output_voltage_range {{lower_bound upper_bound}...}? ?-direction low_to_high|high_to_low|both? ?-input_power_pin power_pin? ?-output_power_pin power_pin? ?-input_ground_pin ground_pin? ?-output_ground_pin ground_pin? ?-ground ground_pin? ?-power power_pin? ?-enable pin | -pin_groups {{input_pin output_pin ?enable_pin?}...}? ?-valid_location source|sink|either|any? ?-bypass_enable expression? ?-multi_stage integer?", surface: None, lifecycle: Lifecycle { introduced: None, deprecated: None, retired: None, deprecation_fix: None } }], command_forms: [], semantic_operation: None, semantic_operation_windows: [], completion: None, result_stability: None, native_result: None, assigns_variable_at: None, safe_on_uninit: None, const_fold: None, const_fold_versioned: None, lowering_hook: None, bpf_op: None, codegen_hook: None, codegen_hook_windows: [], inline_codegen_hook: None, inline_codegen_hook_windows: [], native_lowering: N